  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU support to essential water and sanitation services in Lebanon</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Overall Objective/Impact of this action is to contribute to the development of effective, reliable and self-financed public water and wastewater services in Lebanon The Specific Objective/Outcome of this action is:-Preserving the provision of essential public water and wastewater services for refugees from Syria and host Lebanese communities until cost recovery is ensured by the end of the Water Sector Recovery Plan</narrative>
  </description>
